 something different — a collection of tools that put \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#110f0f]\",\"children\":\"people first\"}],\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"MsgReplier was founded on a simple idea: technology should bring couples\",\" \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"closer\"}],\", not exploit their attention or compromise their privacy. Every tool we build starts with that principle. We ask ourselves: \\\"Is this genuinely useful? Does it respect the user's privacy? Can we make it beautiful and delightful to use?\\\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"We are based in \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#110f0f]\",\"children\":\"India 🇮🇳\"}],\" and serve users globally. Our platform handles thousands of Wishes Websites and Love-Space sessions every month, and we are proud that our users trust us with their most personal moments.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-16 text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-[#110f0f]\",\"children\":\"What We Build\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"Love-Space\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-[24px] border border-[#d4c3ab] p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-4\",\"children\":\"💑\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-[#110f0f]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"href\":\"/love-space\",\"className\":\"hover:underline hover:text-[#948678] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Love-Space\"}]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#5d6c7b] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"A private, temporary digital room for couples to chat in real time, play games (Ludo, Tic Tac Toe, Snake & Ladder), and stay connected. No login required — your room auto-deletes after 24 hours.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Wishes Website Builder\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-[24px] border border-[#d4c3ab] p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-4\",\"children\":\"🎁\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-[#110f0f]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"href\":\"/digital-greeting\",\"className\":\"hover:underline hover:text-[#948678] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Wishes Website Builder\"}]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#5d6c7b] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Create a beautiful, animated, interactive digital greeting page for birthdays, anniversaries, Valentine's Day, and more. Personalise it with music, themes, and a heartfelt message — then share a unique link.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"FLAMES Calculator\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-[24px] border border-[#d4c3ab] p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-4\",\"children\":\"🔥\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-[#110f0f]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"href\":\"/flames\",\"className\":\"hover:underline hover:text-[#948678] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"FLAMES Calculator\"}]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#5d6c7b] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"The classic childhood love compatibility game, reimagined for the web. Enter two names and instantly find out if you are destined for Friendship, Love, Affection, Marriage, Enemy, or Sibling status!\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"AI Couple Prompts\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-[24px] border border-[#d4c3ab] p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-4\",\"children\":\"📸\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-[#110f0f]\",\"c